# What the two leaves emit into themselves.
#
# Both setup.py files run a generator before setuptools is told the
# sources exist, so a local `pip install .` leaves its output in the
# tree. Everything below is written, never hand-edited - and an
# untracked generated file that the build quietly depends on is a bug
# this repo has already had once.
packages/huggorm-bindings/huggorm_bindings/*
!packages/huggorm-bindings/huggorm_bindings/__init__.py
packages/huggorm-generated/huggorm_generated/
packages/huggorm-generated/huggorm_bindings-stubs/

# generated C++
*.c

